#. y1:english_ids=["74_0_0","74_0_1","74_0_2","74_0_3","74_0_4","74_0_5","74_0_6","74_0_7","74_0_8","74_0_9","74_0_10","74_0_11","74_0_12","74_0_13","74_0_14","74_0_15","74_0_16","74_0_17","74_0_18","74_0_19","74_0_20","74_0_21","74_0_22","74_0_23","74_0_24","74_0_25","74_0_26","74_0_27","74_0_28","74_0_29","74_0_30","74_0_31","74_0_32","74_0_33","74_0_34","74_0_35","74_0_36","74_0_37","74_0_38","74_0_39","74_0_40","74_0_41","74_0_42","74_0_43","74_0_44","74_0_45","74_0_46","74_0_47","74_0_48","74_0_49","74_0_50","74_0_51","74_0_52","74_0_53","74_0_54","74_0_55","74_0_56","74_0_57","74_0_58","74_0_59","74_0_60","74_0_61","74_0_62","74_0_63","74_0_64","74_0_65","74_0_66","74_0_67","74_0_68","74_0_69","74_0_70","74_0_71","74_0_72","74_0_73","74_0_74","74_0_75","74_0_76","74_0_77","74_0_78","74_0_79"]
#. y1:english="\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHey...{PA:20} you Aoki?\nHuh...? {PA:10}Oh, Kazuma-san?{PA:10}||From the Dojima Family?\nYeah. {PA:20}You remembered me, huh?{PA:20} I haven't||set foot in this town for a long time.\nI'm glad you made it outta prison.{PA:20}||10 years is awfully long.\nYou knew I was in the joint?\nOf course.{PA:10}||Everyone in this town back then knew.\nThe famous \"Dragon of the Dojima Family\"||killed his own Oyabun.\nThat story was all over the headlines.\nI see.\n...By the way,||where is Tamura these days?\n...Tamura-san died 5 years ago.\nWhat?!\nSince the killing 10 years ago,{PA:10}\nTamura-san set out to uncover||the truth behind what happened.\nHe always said, \"Kazuma-san would be||the last person to kill his Oyabun.\"\n...Although he wasn't a reporter by trade,\nhe was very forceful||when he interrogated people.\n...Of course, it was a huge story\nfor someone who makes a living off||of trading information.\nBut,||Tamura-san was not your average guy.\n...One day,{PA:10} 5 years ago,{PA:10}||he disappeared into thin air.\nA week later, they found his body||in concrete at the bottom of the bay...\nI think he knew too much.\nI didn't know that...\nPersonally, I owe Tamura-san a lot.||I was getting a lot of great info from him.\nWe worked together for several years.\nSo, I wanted to gather juicy information||for him.\nThat's why I became a reporter||and informant.\n...So,{PA:10} Kazuma-san.{PA:10}||Do you want any information?\nIs there anything else||you want to know about?\nIs there anything else||you want to know about?\nIs there anything else||you want to know about?\nIs there anything else||you want to know about?\nIs there anything else||you want to know about?\nIs there anything else||you want to know about?\nNo, thanks.\nYou're welcome...\nI'm not as good as Tamura,||but I get the job done.\nPlease come to me when you need information.\nStardust? Yeah.{PA:10}||It's a {MS:0}\"{CC:ffc8c8}host bar on Tenkaichi St.{CR:00}\"\nHost bar?\nYeah. {PA:20}There were no host bars||on Tenkaichi St. 10 years ago,\nbut over time, they made their way up from||the back streets to the main streets.\nStardust seems to be the most popular||host bar around.\nI see.\nIt's right across the street from Serena,||the bar you frequently visited 10 years ago\nYou'll know it when you see it.\n\nIs Serena still there?\nSerena?{PA:10} Yes, it is.{PA:20}||Same place as 10 years ago.\nBut they're closed today.\nDoes Reina still run the place?\nYes. She's alive and kicking.\nI hear, she only opens to regulars.\nTamura once took me there. Nice place.\nThere aren't too many places like Serena||in this town these days,\nwhere you can sit down||and have a nice quiet drink.\n...Come to think of it, I saw some delivery||boys go in and out a few minutes ago.\nMaybe they'll be open tomorrow.||Why don't you go, if you have the time?\n\nDid anything happen on Nakamichi St.?\nOh yeah, {PA:10}that racket.{PA:20} ...I don't||know exactly what happened just yet,\nbut I heard a Captain||from the Tojo Clan was killed there.\nCaptain?\nYes.{PA:20}||Judging by the number of cops there,{PA:10}\nthe victim must've been||someone very important.\n...To be honest, {PA:10}it reminded||me of what happened 10 years ago.\nThis situation is awfully||similar to Dojima's killing.\nWho killed that guy?\nNo one knows yet.\n...But there's a rumour going around that||it's another internal conflict.\nSince you've been gone,||the Tojo Clan's run into a lot of troubles.\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0005.BIN:74_0_7
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0005.BIN::line:74_0_7"
msgid "Hey... {PA:10}¿eres Aoki?{PA:20}"
msgstr ""

