 {PA:20}There were no host bars||on Tenkaichi St. 10 years ago,\nbut over time, they made their way up from||the back streets to the main streets.\nStardust seems to be the most popular||host bar around.\nI see.\nIt's right across the street from Serena,||the bar you frequently visited 10 years ago\nYou'll know it when you see it.\n\nIs Serena still there?\nSerena?{PA:10} Yes, it is.{PA:20}||Same place as 10 years ago.\nBut they're closed today.\nDoes Reina still run the place?\nYes. She's alive and kicking.\nI hear, she only opens to regulars.\nTamura once took me there. Nice place.\nThere aren't too many places like Serena||in this town these days,\nwhere you can sit down||and have a nice quiet drink.\n...Come to think of it, I saw some delivery||boys go in and out a few minutes ago.\nMaybe they'll be open tomorrow.||Why don't you go, if you have the time?\n\nDid anything happen on Nakamichi St.?\nOh yeah, {PA:10}that racket.{PA:20} ...I don't||know exactly what happened just yet,\nbut I heard a Captain||from the Tojo Clan was killed there.\nCaptain?\nYes.{PA:20}||Judging by the number of cops there,{PA:10}\nthe victim must've been||someone very important.\n...To be honest, {PA:10}it reminded||me of what happened 10 years ago.\nThis situation is awfully||similar to Dojima's killing.\nWho killed that guy?\nNo one knows yet.\n...But there's a rumour going around that||it's another internal conflict.\nSince you've been gone,||the Tojo Clan's run into a lot of troubles.\n"
