#. y1:english="You up to something already, {PA:10}Kazuma-san?\nWhat're you talking about?\nWell, {PA:10}there was some ruckus||on Tenkaichi St. and when I went to check...\nI saw some Yakuza who got beat up, running||away. {PA:20}I figured it was you who beat them up.\nYou got a good eye.\nYou're damn right I do.{PA:20}||How else am I gonna get good info?\nStill, {PA:10}the news about your release\nis all over town by now.\nFrom this point on, the Tojo Clan is your||enemy. {PA:20}I'd watch my back, if I were you.\nHmm...{PA:10} You're probably right.\nBut still, I didn't come back here||to fight with the Tojo Clan.\n...But {PA:10}you're gonna||go to the funeral, aren't you?\nHow the hell did you know that?!{PA:10}\nHehe... {PA:20}Instinct.\n...As soon as the chairman||of the Tojo clan was killed,\n\"The Dragon of the Dojima Family\" returned.\nThere's gotta be something going on...{PA:20}||But don't worry about it now.\nI got your back, Kazuma-san.{PA:20}||I won't say a word to anyone about you."
