#. y1:english="\n\n\nHello,{PA:10} Kazuma-san.{PA:10}||Did you go to Serena?\nAhh, you know.\nYeah. {PA:10}When I was on my way||back from the office,\nI noticed that the lights were on||in Serena, {PA:10}so I figured they were open.\nBy the way, {PA:10}do you know||anything about a bar called \"Bacchus\"?\nBacchus...{PA:10} Yeah,{PA:10}||the bar right by the Millennium Tower.\nI know about it.\nIs there anything else you wanna know about?\nIs there anything else you wanna know about?\nYeah,{PA:10}||I'm sure most connoisseurs know about it.\nThe bartender has a wide knowledge||of beverages and a huge selection.\nIf you would rather enjoy a nice drink than||hanging out with girls,\nthat's the place for you.\n\nThat building over there.\nIt's a skyscraper office building||that was built a few years ago.\nIt was planned to be built||in the centre of this city,{PA:10}\nbut because residents complained that||it would block sunlight, it was called off.\nHowever, with the backing of||some shady organisation,{PA:10}\nthey went ahead with construction.\nThis building has a long story behind it.\nA shady organisation... {PA:20}The Yakuza?\nYeah, {PA:20}probably.||I think the Tojo Clan was involved.\nThe inside is just like any other office||building, but corporate associates\nor what they call \"fronts\" aren't in there.\nI'm not sure what the purpose of||the building was...\nI see.\n\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0005.BIN:74_3_3
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0005.BIN::line:74_3_3"
msgid "Hola, {PA:10}Kazuma-san.||¿Has ido a Serena?"
msgstr ""

