#. y1:english="By the way,||do you know a bar called \"Ares\"?\nAres?{PA:10}||The legendary bar?\nLegendary?\nYes. There was once a rumour floating||around town about Ares.\nBut no one has ever confirmed the rumour.\nNo one knows its location,{PA:10}||who goes there, {PA:10}or what the bar is like.\nAll I know is that||the owner's name is \"Mizuki\".\nI see. I was told that the bartender||of Bacchus knows where it is.\nReally?{PA:10}||That's interesting.\nI'll go ask him now.\nIf his information is correct,{PA:10}||please let me know!\nI have a deadline for an article today,{PA:10}||so I have to get back to the office.\nSee you tomorrow!\nGot it. See you later."
