#. y1:english="Ah,{PA:10} Kazuma-san,{PA:10}||you're alive.\nWhat are you talking about?\nHm?{PA:10} You said you were going to||Bacchus yesterday.\nAnd when I went there this morning,{PA:10}||the bar had closed down.\nI was worried that you got involved||in something bad.\nNo,{PA:10} I wasn't involved,{PA:10}||but I did run into some problems.\n...{PA:20}I see.||I didn't know.\nYeah. {PA:20}So, I decided||to go visit \"Kage of Purgatory\".\nWhat?!{PA:10}||You mean the legendary informant?!\nYeah.{PA:20} Come to think of it, Tamura||used to be in the same line of business.\nYeah.{PA:10} Tamura-san often told me about him.\nI once tried to investigate him,{PA:10}||but Purgatory is heavily guarded...\nWhat?{PA:10}||You mean you've been inside Purgatory?\nNo,{PA:10} I couldn't even get close||to the entrance.\nEntrance?\nYes.{PA:20} I hope they didn't change it,{PA:10}\nbut I heard the entrance to Purgatory||is a public restroom.\nHowever, when I went there, {PA:10}there was||nothing that looked like an entrance...\nA public restroom. Okay.{PA:20}||I'll go there.\n...But why did you want to go||check out Purgatory?\nBecause of Tamura-san.\nEven though Tamura-san was reportedly||found in Tokyo Bay, {PA:10}I didn't believe it...\nHe was my mentor.\nSo,{PA:10} I thought I could find out||what \"really happened\",\nthrough the legendary informant.\nI see.\n...Well,{PA:10} I'll ask him about that||if I ever meet him.\nKazuma-san, {PA:20}Purgatory is a very dangerous||place.{PA:10} It's a place shrouded in mystery.\nWatch your back.\n...Yeah, {PA:10}I got it."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0005.BIN:74_5_5
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0005.BIN::line:74_5_5"
msgid "No, {PA:10}no me pasó nada,{PA:20}||pero tuve un par de problemillas."
msgstr ""

